Create the file .cursorrules in the project root with the following content exactly:

# Marketing Mojito — Project Rules

## Architecture
- Next.js 14 (App Router) hybrid site
- Static Webflow HTML pages served via rewrites from public/
- React pages in app/ directory use PageShell component
- Blog system under app/blog/ with content from content/blog-posts.json

## Components
- PageShell: wraps all React pages (Header + Footer + MobileDock + WebflowStyles + WebflowRuntimeScripts)
- Header = AnnouncementBar + Navbar
- All shared components in components/ directory

## CSS
- Webflow CSS loaded globally: normalize.css, webflow.css, marketing-mojitotesting.webflow.css, mobile-dock.css
- All in public/css/
- Use existing Webflow class names for styling — do NOT create new CSS frameworks
- Fonts: Poppins and Unbounded via Google Fonts

## Page Creation Rules
- All new React pages MUST use PageShell
- Do NOT use dangerouslySetInnerHTML for full page bodies
- Convert Webflow HTML to proper JSX (className, self-closing tags, etc.)
- Prefix all image paths with / (src="/images/...")
- Use Next.js Link for internal navigation
- Remove ALL Webflow data-w-id and data-wf-* attributes (they cause IX2 issues)
- Remove ALL inline style attributes from converted HTML (IX2 animation states)
- Keep all Webflow CSS class names exactly as they are

## Converting Static HTML Pages to React
When converting a public/*.html page to a React page:
1. Create app/[page-name]/page.tsx
2. Wrap content in PageShell
3. Convert HTML body (between header and footer) to clean JSX
4. Remove data-w-id, data-wf-*, and inline style attributes
5. Remove page from htmlPages array in next.config.mjs
6. Add redirect: /page-name.html → /page-name
7. Rename public/page-name.html to public/page-name.html.bak
8. Update app/sitemap.ts if needed

## Development
- Use `npm run dev` for development (NOT npm run build)
- Clear cache before dev: `rm -rf .next && npm run dev`
- npm run build is ONLY for deployment
- Deploy via: bash deploy-lightsail.sh

## Common Issues
- "Cannot find module './948.js'" → rm -rf .next && npm run dev
- Hydration errors → check for duplicate HTML (static file + React page both serving)
- Invisible text on converted pages → inline style attributes not stripped
- Mobile nav broken → desktop navbar needs display:none on mobile, MobileDock handles mobile nav

## API Routes
- POST /api/contact — contact form (Resend + Google Sheets)
- POST /api/lead-magnet — lead magnet forms (Resend + Sheets + optional DOCX attachment)
- GET /api/config — public config (reCAPTCHA site key)